00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,380
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) There is a big sale.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,980
Everything is 50% off.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,100
He likes the expensive watch.

4
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:12,860
The original price is $100.

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:17,540
The watch is now $50.

6
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,280
He can afford it now.

7
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,420
